    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890750/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1713050858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890750/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1713050858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890750/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1713050858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You wake up from a cryo sleep aboard the Ark 5 spacecraft and discover that the entire team has disappeared and creepy monsters are walking along the gloomy corridors. The situation is aggravated by the fact that the ship will soon collide with an asteroid. Can you survive and prevent a catastrophe?<br><br>Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of sci-fi horror. Explore the cold and dark decks of the space ark where death may be waiting around every corner.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890750/extras/6eccaf467da0fafbf98c265ce8a0023e.poster.avif?t=1713050858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890750/extras/6eccaf467da0fafbf98c265ce8a0023e.webm?t=1713050858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1890750/extras/6eccaf467da0fafbf98c265ce8a0023e.mp4?t=1713050858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u26ab Two game modes: Story and survival.<br>\u26ab Several characters to choose from with their own characteristics.<br>\u26ab Random generation of levels. A new experience with each new game.<br>\u26ab The ship's dynamic infection system.<br>\u26ab Collect resources and create useful items and weapons.<br>\u26ab Survive with your friends in cooperative mode.",
